{
  "provider": "opencode",
  "note": "Synthetic ChatPart shapes for the OpenCode server. A tool part's data is the message part, toolName is part.tool (or part.type for history). Shapes derived from runtime/src/providers/opencode.rs (opencode_chat_part, opencode_task_part) and qa/fixtures/mock-opencode.mjs. Edit argument names are marked _unverified.",
